{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game operates on the premise of <strong>moving two heavy craniums</strong> that <strong>can only jump</strong> and are <strong>linked by a rope</strong>. With this limitation, you must learn to move in all directions, climb <strong>a surreal set of obstacles</strong> (like in life?), and <strong>perhaps also learn something about yourself</strong>. You can also listen to the characters discuss and react to the problems they face in their particular situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/ezgif-82a75648bafcd2.gif?t=1751644596\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only two buttons to move.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging physics-based gameplay</strong> (Newton would probably find it easy).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The great company of those two</strong> even though they don't get along too well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 - \u221e hours of gameplay depending on your skill level.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fierce effort of endurance and skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/ezgif-88fde614b28af6.gif?t=1751644596\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538140?t=1751644596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538140?t=1751644596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/070a205b96564c553a2c904d8dc82a599a9ccd4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751644596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse